        "name": "时长",
        "value": "47.5s"
      },
      {
        "name": "声音 voice",
        "value": "vinyl"
      },
      {
        "name": "线条片颗粒",
        "value": "原片0–10秒，巧思17.5–27.5秒；const f = Math.floor(t * FPS + 1e-4), r = mulberry(f * 7919 + 13); const ox = Math.floor(r() * 2048), oy = Math.floor(r() * 2048); ctx.globalCompositeOperation = 'overlay'; ctx.globalAlpha = 0.1；径向暗角H * 0.35、W * 0.66。"
      },
      {
        "name": "逐帧纸面颗粒",
        "value": "L800: const GT = 512, GN = new Int8Array(GT * GT);；L805: const k = 2.0 / Math.sqrt(ss / b.length); for (let i = 0; i < b.length; i++) GN[i] = Math.max(-6, Math.min(6, Math.round(b[i] * k))); }；L812: const img = ctx.getImageData(0, 0, W, H), d = img.data, ox = (f * 197) % GT, oy = (f * 331) % GT;"
      },
